### ===========================================
### NOTES FOR TESTING
### ===========================================

# 1. Update the @baseUrl variable at the top to match your server URL
# 2. Make sure your server is running before testing
# 3. For local testing, use: http://localhost:3000/api
# 4. For production, use your deployed URL
# 5. Change the email addresses in the @testEmail variables to avoid conflicts
# 6. The payment webhook tests are for when you re-enable Chapa integration
# 7. Tests 5 and 6 are designed to fail - they test error handling
# 8. Make sure your database is connected and running
